n J&amp;K Kulgam encounter; SC grants bail to 2 Bilkis Bano case convicts &amp; more]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/evening-news-wrap-terrorist-killed-in-jk-kulgam-encounter-sc-grants-bail-to-2-bilkis-bano-case-convicts-more/articleshow/135885142.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135885142.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/evening-news-wrap-terrorist-killed-in-jk-kulgam-encounter-sc-grants-bail-to-2-bilkis-bano-case-convicts-more/articleshow/135885142.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/evening-news-wrap-terrorist-killed-in-jk-kulgam-encounter-sc-grants-bail-to-2-bilkis-bano-case-convicts-more/articleshow/135885142.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-16T17:12:03+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Priyanka Jaiswal</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135885142,imgsize-189382.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA['No one excluded': CM Yogi Adityanath says Census 2027 will ensure welfare benefits for all]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/no-one-excluded-cm-yogi-adityanath-says-census-2027-will-ensure-welfare-benefits-for-all/articleshow/135887429.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135887429.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[In a significant move for Census 2027, Chief Minister Yogi Adityanath has initiated the self-enumeration process in Lucknow. Emphasizing the importance of precise data for identifying individuals missing from welfare initiatives, he outlined how this census will collect vital demographic details to inform the development of crucial infrastructure such as health centers and schools.]]></d