/item><item><title><![CDATA[Ajit Pawar plane crash: Maharashtra CM urges Amit Shah to fast-track probe, release early report]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/ajit-pawar-plane-crash-maharashtra-cm-urges-amit-shah-to-fast-track-probe-release-early-report/articleshow/135884242.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135884242.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/ajit-pawar-plane-crash-maharashtra-cm-urges-amit-shah-to-fast-track-probe-release-early-report/articleshow/135884242.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/ajit-pawar-plane-crash-maharashtra-cm-urges-amit-shah-to-fast-track-probe-release-early-report/articleshow/135884242.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-16T16:09:43+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Priyanka Jaiswal</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135884570,imgsize-175858.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Union minister Suresh Gopi says diesel, price cuts 'not possible right away'; cites Rs 42,000 crore losses]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/union-minister-suresh-gopi-says-diesel-price-cuts-not-possible-right-away-cites-rs-42000-crore-losses/articleshow/135883418.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135883418.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[Union Minister Suresh Gopi highlighted the challenges posed by Rs 42,000 crore losses in the oil sector, stating that lowering fuel prices is currently impractical. While consumers are eager for cuts, he noted that immediate adjustments are not feasible. Furthermore, he encouraged state governments to ease tax burdens on petrol.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/union-minister-suresh-gopi-says-diesel-price-cuts-not-possible-right-away-cites-rs-42000-crore-losses/articleshow/135883418.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/union-minister-suresh-gopi-says-diesel-price-cuts-not-possible-right-away-cites-rs-42000-crore-losses/articleshow/135883418.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-16T15:59:53+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Trisha Mahajan</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135884136,imgsize-75210.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA['Who ordered SIR?' Congress seeks SC nod to pose 48 questions to EC, CEC Gyanesh Kumar over 'vote chori']]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/who-ordered-sir-congress-seeks-sc-nod-to-pose-48-questions-to-ec-cec-gyanesh-kumar-over-vote-chori/articleshow/135882883.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135882883.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[In a significant move, Congress has voiced its apprehensions over the Election Commission of India's affidavit to the Supreme Court. They emphasize that their pressing inquiries into purported electoral roll irregularities remain largely unaddressed. The party has compiled a list of 48 detailed questions for the Election Commission, focusing on aspects such as the Special Intensive Revision process.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/who-ordered-sir-congress-seeks-sc-nod-to-pose-48-questions-to-ec-cec-gyanesh-kumar-over-vote-chori/articleshow/135882883.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/who-ordered-sir-congress-seeks-sc-nod-to-pose-48-questions-to-ec-cec-gyanesh-kumar-over-vote-chori/articleshow/135882883.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-16T15:38:00+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Priyanka Jaiswal</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135883033,imgsize-61476.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Parents fled Mozambique with unregistered newborn; 26 yrs later, Gujarat woman gets Indian passport]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/parents-fled-mozambique-with-unregistered-newborn-26-yrs-later-gujarat-woman-gets-indian-passport/articleshow/135880565.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135880565.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[Dolly Vadalia, originally from Mozambique, encountered significant obstacles in her quest for Indian citizenship due to a lack of documentation. After her marriage in 2023, multiple attempts to secure her passport were denied due to her parents' failure to register her birth. However, the Indian embassy stepped in to ensure her birth was recorded, and on November 11, she finally obtained her Indian passport.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/parents-fled-mozambique-with-unregistered-newborn-26-yrs-later-gujarat-woman-gets-indian-passport/articleshow/135880565.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/parents-fled-mozambique-with-unregistered-newborn-26-yrs-later-gujarat-woman-gets-indian-passport/articleshow/135880565.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-16T15:16:23+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Aastha Jha</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135881874,imgsize-41734.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA['When CM was unavailable, Ajit Pawar was there': Amit Shah remembers ex-Maharashtra deputy CM]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/when-cm-was-unavailable-ajit-pawar-was-there-amit-shah-remembers-ex-maharashtra-deputy-cm/articleshow/135880847.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135880847.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[During a significant bust unveiling event, Amit Shah shared heartfelt condolences on the untimely passing of Ajit Pawar. He acknowledged Pawar’s impactful contributions, especially during the challenging Covid-19 pandemic, contrasting his proactive approach with prior government communication challenges. Meanwhile, Maharashtra’s Chief Minister, Devendra Fadnavis, urgently called for the swift release of the investigation report into the tragic plane crash that took Ajit Pawar's life on January 28.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/when-cm-was-unavailable-ajit-pawar-was-there-amit-shah-remembers-ex-maharashtra-deputy-cm/articleshow/135880847.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/when-cm-was-unavailable-ajit-pawar-was-there-amit-shah-remembers-ex-maharashtra-deputy-cm/articleshow/135880847.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-16T15:16:14+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Trisha Mahajan</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135881778,imgsize-42224.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Faster shift to electricity can save India Rs 9.6 lakh crore in fuel imports annually by FY35: Study]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/faster-shift-to-electricity-can-save-india-rs-9-6-lakh-crore-in-fuel-imports-annually-by-fy35-study/articleshow/135880982.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135880982.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/faster-shift-to-electricity-can-save-india-rs-9-6-lakh-crore-in-fuel-imports-annually-by-fy35-study/articleshow/135880982.cms]]></link><gu